# Real central with Vvir > Vcrit: R0 reference model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 6d859a3a2ea422e3...), Snap_32 row 0, GalaxyIndex 0: end-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time state.
